{"ref":"BDB, עֲזוּבָה²","hw":"עֲזוּבָה²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֲזוּבָה</span></big>  <strong>n. pr. f. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  Αζαεβα, Αζονβα, mother of Jehoshaphat <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:42\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.42\">1 K 22:42</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:31\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.31\">2 Ch 20:31</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  (Γ)αζουβα, wife of Caleb <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.18\">1 Ch 2:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.19\">19</a>.","next":"BDB, עִזָּבוֹן","prev":"BDB, עֲזוּבָה"}